namespace tools: preserve supported child management on wasm

Mount namespaces are available in the target kernel, so retain direct and
supervised unshare operation plus mount-namespace persistence with synchronized
callback children. Reject only nsenter continuations tied to unavailable user
and PID namespace behavior; native builds retain fork.

